Attribution / inspiration
----------------------------------------------------------------------

skill-steward distills four patterns from "task-observer" (repository:
one-skill-to-rule-them-all) by Eoghan Henn / rebelytics.com, licensed under
CC BY 4.0:

  https://github.com/rebelytics/one-skill-to-rule-them-all

The patterns adopted are: full-bundle staging of proposed changes, a
pre-delivery bundle completeness check, bounded-mutation (fresh-read, locked,
append-only) writes to a shared log, and a pre-publish confidentiality sweep.

All text, procedures, and scripts in this repository are original expression
written for skill-steward, not copied from the source work. skill-steward
deliberately does NOT adopt task-observer's autonomous behaviors (automatic
activation, scheduled unattended review, direct application of changes to live
skills, automatic deletion, or fetching external content as instructions).

This attribution is provided in fulfillment of the CC BY 4.0 attribution
requirement for building upon the ideas of the source work.
